# Optional Configuration for Pulse n Care
# Project runs 100% out-of-the-box without these variables.

# Lead capture endpoint (e.g., Formspree, Zapier Webhook, CRM URL)
# If left empty, form inquiries automatically open WhatsApp with a prefilled message to the 24x7 desk (+91 92117 65429).
# VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

# Optional Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID
# VITE_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
